                        p-s-col1 p-xs-col1"> <span><p><strong>Philips Museum&nbsp;</strong></p> <p>Emmasingel 31&nbsp;</p> <p>5611 AZ Eindhoven</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Receptie</strong></p> <p>+31 (0)40 235 90&nbsp;30&nbsp;</p> <p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#c4adaaa2abe9a9b1b7a1b1a984b4acada8adb4b7eaa7aba9" data-track-description="info_museum_philips_com" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="a7cec9c1c88acad2d4c2d2cae7d7cfcecbced7d489c4c8ca">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Boekingen &amp; Sales&nbsp;</strong></p> <p>+31 (0)40 235 90 30</p> <p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#41232e242a282f26242f6c2c343224342c013129282d2831326f222e2c" data-track-description="boekingen_museum_philips_com" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="7e1c111b151710191b1053130b0d1b0b133e0e161712170e0d501d1113">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Pers</strong></p> <p><a href="https://www.philips.nl/a-w/philips-museum/pers.html" data-track-description="Pers_&amp;_media" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink">Pers &amp; media</a></p> <p>+31 (0)6 15 89 14 42</p> <p><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#52313d3f3f273c3b3133263b3d3c217f3f272137273f12223a3b3e3b22217c313d3f" data-track-description="communications_museum_philips_com" data-track-type="track-conversion" data-track-name="interaction" data-track-compid="gc11" class="p-gc11v3-inlinelink"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="11727e7c7c647f78727065787e7f623c7c646274647c516179787d7861623f727e7c">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p></span> </p> </div> </div> </section> </div> </div> </section> </div> </div> <div class="p-grid-item 
                                           
                                           
